  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">取引先との関係強化</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
